# WGSL: WebGPU Shading Language (W3C Working Draft), 15 Keyword and Token Summary; requirements/languages/wgsl.md
name     wgsl
keyword  fn let var const override struct alias if else switch case default loop for while break continue
keyword  return discard enable requires diagnostic
type     bool i32 u32 f32 f16 vec2 vec3 vec4 mat2x2 mat3x3 mat4x4 array atomic ptr sampler texture_2d
type     vec2f vec3f vec4f vec2i vec3u mat4x4f
builtin  true false dot cross normalize length mix clamp max min abs select textureSample
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */  : nested
sigil    @    : meta
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
calls
